WEBVTT

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:10.280
Stop!

00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:11.300
Take that!

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:26.140
Found it!

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:27.560
Isn't that...

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:28.300
A candy!

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:29.230
Er...

00:00:29.230 --> 00:00:31.050
Aah...

00:00:31.050 --> 00:00:32.200
You're not getting it!

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:33.800
No, no, no! Don't!

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.800
You can't eat that!

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:43.930
Yayaka?

00:00:44.650 --> 00:00:45.780
What's up?

00:00:49.430 --> 00:00:52.030
You look a bit better now.

00:00:53.260 --> 00:00:54.320
Cocona!

00:00:54.770 --> 00:00:56.810
Play with me!

00:00:56.810 --> 00:00:57.850
What's with you?

00:00:57.850 --> 00:00:59.950
Why're you the only one 
wearing that weird thing?

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:01.580
It's not weird.

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:03.970
It's called a... school swimsuit?

00:01:04.210 --> 00:01:05.970
And that ring thing.

00:01:08.890 --> 00:01:11.500
I can't take it off.

00:01:12.830 --> 00:01:14.030
Let's go, Cocona.

00:01:14.030 --> 00:01:14.610
Wai—

00:01:14.610 --> 00:01:15.140
Wha—

00:01:15.140 --> 00:01:16.250
Papika!

00:01:16.610 --> 00:01:17.470
Hey!

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:28.060
Cocona!

00:01:35.950 --> 00:01:36.200
Hole

00:01:42.030 --> 00:01:42.840
Tch.

00:01:53.820 --> 00:01:55.840
Better hurry up and finish it.

00:02:02.310 --> 00:02:04.020
Hey, isn't this...

00:02:06.460 --> 00:02:08.220
Pure Illusion.

00:03:40.020 --> 00:03:44.020
Hidaka-san, how're the repairs 
on that terminal going?

00:03:44.020 --> 00:03:45.200
It's right there.

00:03:45.480 --> 00:03:48.210
And where exactly is "there"?

00:03:48.210 --> 00:03:50.450
Are your eyes filled with junk?

00:03:50.890 --> 00:03:53.340
This room is what's filled with junk!

00:03:54.060 --> 00:03:58.090
I'm sure it looks that way to 
someone with a tainted heart.

00:03:58.090 --> 00:03:59.080
Wha...

00:03:59.080 --> 00:04:01.250
I have not been tainted!

00:04:01.250 --> 00:04:04.050
If you're not gonna clean up this 
crap, I'll throw it all out!

00:04:04.050 --> 00:04:05.240
I refuse!

00:04:05.240 --> 00:04:07.470
If you've got time to waste on that,

00:04:07.470 --> 00:04:09.920
then bring me a cup of tea instead!

00:04:09.920 --> 00:04:12.640
Like I care. If you want 
tea, get it yourself!

00:04:17.560 --> 00:04:20.310
There's no fragment or food here.

00:04:20.310 --> 00:04:22.570
I'd like some clothes instead.

00:04:23.140 --> 00:04:24.670
Is this edible?

00:04:24.670 --> 00:04:26.690
It probably doesn't taste very good.

00:04:29.730 --> 00:04:31.400
Not yummy...

00:04:31.690 --> 00:04:33.910
Don't come crying to me 
if you get electrocuted.

00:04:36.570 --> 00:04:38.150
What a strange place.

00:04:39.060 --> 00:04:40.980
Did someone build all this?

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:47.470
Excuse me...

00:04:47.960 --> 00:04:50.810
Have you seen a sparkly stone around he—

00:04:53.160 --> 00:04:55.600
Sorry! I thought you were someone else!

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:03.880
You okay, Cocona?

00:05:03.880 --> 00:05:05.070
Y-Yeah.

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:09.380
Cocona.

00:05:09.380 --> 00:05:10.080
Yeah.

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:12.000
Flip Flapping!

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:12.000
Flip Flapping!

00:05:21.840 --> 00:05:22.490
Hup.

00:05:27.820 --> 00:05:29.260
That little...

00:05:29.550 --> 00:05:30.350
Papika!

00:05:30.350 --> 00:05:31.310
Behind you!

00:05:36.560 --> 00:05:37.580
There are more!

00:05:37.810 --> 00:05:39.240
A third?!

00:05:46.230 --> 00:05:47.370
Yayaka!

00:05:47.960 --> 00:05:49.730
We got called out during class.

00:05:50.120 --> 00:05:51.120
Pool class.

00:05:51.430 --> 00:05:53.620
But it's a good thing we hurried here, right?

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:54.790
Gonna save them?

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:56.070
What?

00:05:56.070 --> 00:05:58.960
You want them to take the amorphous?

00:05:59.970 --> 00:06:01.660
Location still unknown.

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:05.570
That's obviously the 
amorphous's defense trap!

00:06:07.550 --> 00:06:09.800
Stay put!

00:06:18.550 --> 00:06:19.480
One left.

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:27.150
Uh...

00:06:27.730 --> 00:06:28.680
Thanks, Yayaka.

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:30.250
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:06:31.080 --> 00:06:32.000
How's it look?

00:06:32.480 --> 00:06:33.370
Bust.

00:06:33.370 --> 00:06:34.410
Waste of energy.

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:36.620
Let's go.

00:06:45.700 --> 00:06:48.720
If you want to take them out, 
you have to crush their skulls.

00:06:49.830 --> 00:06:52.890
It's not often this place gets 
visitors from another world.

00:06:53.270 --> 00:06:55.980
But I guess this is fate.

00:07:01.470 --> 00:07:02.720
Who are you?

00:07:03.610 --> 00:07:05.310
No need for you to know.

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:07.730
Er, uh...

00:07:07.730 --> 00:07:11.990
But, when you address me, 
call me the Great White Creator!

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:14.990
And the Almighty Ruler...

00:07:14.990 --> 00:07:16.250
Say, Pops.

00:07:18.010 --> 00:07:19.580
Pops?

00:07:20.700 --> 00:07:22.240
That's not half bad, either.

00:07:22.930 --> 00:07:26.100
Uh, Pops...san?

00:07:26.100 --> 00:07:27.000
What is it?

00:07:27.170 --> 00:07:29.550
Thank you for saving us earlier.

00:07:29.820 --> 00:07:32.550
We're looking for something.

00:07:34.480 --> 00:07:35.800
Detected signal.

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:37.210
It's moving.

00:07:37.210 --> 00:07:39.810
So it <i>was</i> one of those monsters.

00:07:40.630 --> 00:07:41.560
Earlier...

00:07:42.080 --> 00:07:43.560
Why did you save them?

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:47.190
What? Didn't you hear what I told them?

00:07:48.290 --> 00:07:49.420
Wrong idea?

00:07:49.420 --> 00:07:50.440
Sure hope so.

00:07:50.700 --> 00:07:52.570
What's that supposed to mean?

00:07:53.020 --> 00:07:54.000
Found it.

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:56.450
Tch!

00:07:57.520 --> 00:07:59.950
This is the first time I've 
ever let anyone in here.

00:08:02.300 --> 00:08:05.080
Welcome to my castle, my pride and joy.

00:08:05.480 --> 00:08:07.210
Take a seat wherever.

00:08:07.210 --> 00:08:09.270
It's cold here!

00:08:09.270 --> 00:08:12.700
Uh, could you lend us something to wear?

00:08:13.590 --> 00:08:15.140
Pick whatever you like.

00:08:16.480 --> 00:08:17.830
They're all the same?

00:08:18.230 --> 00:08:19.410
It's my aesthetic.

00:08:20.510 --> 00:08:22.890
They showed up out of nowhere.

00:08:30.080 --> 00:08:31.150
The parakeets from earlier!

00:08:31.390 --> 00:08:34.380
They keep destroying my city.

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:35.490
Your city?

00:08:35.490 --> 00:08:36.220
That's right!

00:08:36.960 --> 00:08:39.370
I built this entire city by myself!

00:08:39.370 --> 00:08:42.870
I spent years and years 
building each of its parts!

00:08:43.210 --> 00:08:45.720
It's a symbol of my overflowing intellect!

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:52.620
They're all my creations.

00:08:59.170 --> 00:09:00.430
Um, I...

00:09:06.310 --> 00:09:08.060
It's heading this way?

00:09:08.460 --> 00:09:09.280
A fragment?

00:09:09.280 --> 00:09:10.310
Yeah.

00:09:11.220 --> 00:09:12.130
I'll go!

00:09:12.130 --> 00:09:14.620
I have something I want to protect, too!

00:09:14.910 --> 00:09:16.070
That'd be reckless.

00:09:16.270 --> 00:09:18.250
That thing is massive.

00:09:19.900 --> 00:09:20.940
It's okay.

00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:24.060
We're big, too!

00:09:24.060 --> 00:09:24.830
Ow!

00:09:35.680 --> 00:09:37.050
What are you doing?

00:09:38.820 --> 00:09:39.940
Yayaka?

00:09:42.880 --> 00:09:43.730
No way.

00:09:46.970 --> 00:09:48.080
That's...

00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:49.620
a fragment?

00:09:58.890 --> 00:10:00.880
What the heck is their deal?

00:10:00.880 --> 00:10:01.530
Hey!

00:10:01.900 --> 00:10:03.240
No need to tell me. I'm on it.

00:10:21.930 --> 00:10:23.280
Barely safe.

00:10:23.740 --> 00:10:26.520
Though it hasn't taken any damage, either.

00:10:26.880 --> 00:10:28.350
Let me down already.

00:10:30.190 --> 00:10:32.480
That monstrosity's way too insane!

00:10:32.480 --> 00:10:34.360
Amorphous signal's coming from inside it.

00:10:34.700 --> 00:10:36.860
What are we supposed to do 
about something that huge?

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:38.550
There's gotta be a way!

00:10:38.550 --> 00:10:39.420
Danger.

00:10:41.650 --> 00:10:42.450
Ha...

00:10:42.450 --> 00:10:44.080
Hand!

00:10:46.320 --> 00:10:47.880
Wh-What the?

00:10:47.880 --> 00:10:49.330
Now's your chance! Get in!

00:10:52.490 --> 00:10:54.560
This place won't last long.

00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:56.920
Very well.

00:10:57.230 --> 00:10:58.840
It just means the time has come.

00:10:59.120 --> 00:11:01.340
Huh? What're you babbling about?

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:04.200
And who's this tiny old man, anyway?

00:11:04.200 --> 00:11:05.600
Pops.

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:08.450
Anyway, we have to hurry 
up and get out of here!

00:11:08.880 --> 00:11:10.600
Can't do that, I'm afraid.

00:11:11.370 --> 00:11:13.720
If this place is destroyed, 
the city's done for.

00:11:13.720 --> 00:11:15.070
But at this rate—

00:11:15.300 --> 00:11:19.180
What's the point of surviving if I lose 
what's precious to me in the process?!

00:11:23.290 --> 00:11:25.200
Hey, this looks really bad.

00:11:27.360 --> 00:11:28.580
Fine.

00:11:29.700 --> 00:11:31.000
I'll stop it.

00:11:32.890 --> 00:11:33.590
Reckless.

00:11:33.590 --> 00:11:34.630
Thoughtless.

00:11:34.860 --> 00:11:37.180
You know that's impossible!

00:11:38.310 --> 00:11:41.840
I was scared of coming to Pure Illusion.

00:11:42.660 --> 00:11:44.660
Because I might change something again.

00:11:45.520 --> 00:11:47.600
I might destroy something again.

00:11:48.410 --> 00:11:50.600
But I'm not scared anymore.

00:11:50.910 --> 00:11:53.760
I want to protect what's 
precious with my own hands!

00:11:55.110 --> 00:11:56.740
Me, too!

00:11:56.740 --> 00:11:58.350
I won't let you go!

00:12:03.350 --> 00:12:05.480
You girls might be able to handle it.

00:12:05.480 --> 00:12:06.370
What?

00:12:06.920 --> 00:12:09.970
Then I shall entrust you with 
the power of rebellion!

00:12:17.540 --> 00:12:18.580
This is...

00:12:19.580 --> 00:12:21.660
Isn't it a bit small?

00:12:21.660 --> 00:12:23.260
No, you're just too big.

00:12:23.520 --> 00:12:25.380
Wow, awesome!

00:12:25.380 --> 00:12:28.760
Come on, hurry up and pack 
in that massive rump of yours.

00:12:29.050 --> 00:12:30.020
This is too cramped.

00:12:30.380 --> 00:12:32.850
I can't get all the way in.

00:12:33.670 --> 00:12:35.410
Uh, what now?

00:12:35.410 --> 00:12:37.530
I leave the fate of the city in your hands.

00:12:37.530 --> 00:12:38.690
That's not what I meant...

00:12:38.950 --> 00:12:39.780
Activate!

00:12:50.600 --> 00:12:52.320
This seems like trouble.

00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:00.860
I think I'm gonna be sick.

00:13:00.860 --> 00:13:02.910
I felt a draft down there!

00:13:02.910 --> 00:13:04.760
Where are you, Papika?

00:13:04.760 --> 00:13:05.590
Right here!

00:13:09.320 --> 00:13:12.210
I see how to pilot this thing now!

00:13:12.710 --> 00:13:13.640
Cocona!

00:13:13.640 --> 00:13:15.920
Yeah! Let's do this!

00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:18.270
Unit 01: Vermilion...

00:13:18.730 --> 00:13:20.690
Unit 02: Blau Azur...

00:13:20.690 --> 00:13:21.740
Launch!

00:13:27.270 --> 00:13:28.030
No!

00:13:34.910 --> 00:13:35.960
Take that!

00:13:39.790 --> 00:13:41.100
Me, too!

00:13:49.760 --> 00:13:51.060
Yay!

00:13:55.430 --> 00:13:56.310
Cocona!

00:13:59.340 --> 00:14:00.670
Let go of me!

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:02.570
Wait...

00:14:03.120 --> 00:14:05.570
Don't throw me!

00:14:14.590 --> 00:14:15.670
So pretty.

00:14:18.650 --> 00:14:20.360
Cocona!

00:14:22.620 --> 00:14:23.710
<i>Papika.</i>

00:14:25.890 --> 00:14:27.800
We have to protect the city!

00:14:28.190 --> 00:14:28.950
Yeah!

00:14:30.930 --> 00:14:32.640
<i>Take this!</i>

00:14:32.950 --> 00:14:35.120
Not yet. This isn't enough.

00:14:36.040 --> 00:14:36.890
Hey!

00:14:37.720 --> 00:14:39.050
<i>Pops!</i>

00:14:39.810 --> 00:14:40.770
<i>Papika!</i>

00:14:41.000 --> 00:14:43.020
Isn't there a way to take it out?

00:14:46.520 --> 00:14:48.680
You two might be able to awaken it.

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:51.230
Awaken!

00:14:51.940 --> 00:14:52.990
Sync up...

00:14:53.420 --> 00:14:54.490
...our hearts?

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:56.410
Isn't that...

00:14:58.560 --> 00:15:02.130
Flip Flapping!

00:15:05.290 --> 00:15:06.380
Combine!

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:07.880
Combine?

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:07.880
Combine?

00:15:29.100 --> 00:15:30.450
PapinaKing!

00:15:35.260 --> 00:15:38.710
Your destruction of Pops's city ends here!

00:15:48.250 --> 00:15:49.760
Eat this!

00:15:59.960 --> 00:16:00.930
We did it!

00:16:01.110 --> 00:16:02.010
Not yet!

00:16:21.740 --> 00:16:22.900
Cocona!

00:16:23.870 --> 00:16:24.940
Damn it!

00:16:24.940 --> 00:16:26.940
Hey, old man. Don't you have any more?

00:16:27.950 --> 00:16:29.990
Do you want to save them?

00:16:29.990 --> 00:16:30.630
What?

00:16:30.900 --> 00:16:32.820
I said nothing of the sort!

00:16:32.820 --> 00:16:35.650
I'm asking you if you have 
any more of those robots!

00:16:37.160 --> 00:16:39.800
You've got more, right? Give it to me!

00:16:39.800 --> 00:16:42.200
Okay, but answer my question first.

00:16:42.780 --> 00:16:45.560
Do you want to save those two?

00:16:50.690 --> 00:16:51.510
Stand up!

00:16:51.510 --> 00:16:52.610
Move!

00:16:58.390 --> 00:16:59.240
Huh?

00:17:03.300 --> 00:17:04.590
Yayaka!

00:17:04.590 --> 00:17:06.120
Don't get the wrong idea!

00:17:06.350 --> 00:17:08.080
<i>I'm doing this for the amorphous!</i>

00:17:08.850 --> 00:17:10.240
Hurry up and get in!

00:17:10.880 --> 00:17:12.130
Yapico Mode!

00:17:23.270 --> 00:17:25.060
Yapico Boy!

00:17:30.090 --> 00:17:31.150
Charge!

00:17:54.940 --> 00:17:56.200
We did it!

00:17:56.200 --> 00:17:59.610
It's too early for celebrations.

00:18:05.790 --> 00:18:06.720
Hey!

00:18:07.260 --> 00:18:09.480
This thing has some other gimmick, right?

00:18:10.780 --> 00:18:13.230
Release your impedance!

00:18:13.230 --> 00:18:15.570
<i>Yell like those two!</i>

00:18:15.570 --> 00:18:16.550
Huh?

00:18:16.550 --> 00:18:18.450
Like I could do something that embarrassing!

00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:23.520
Please, Yayaka.

00:18:24.190 --> 00:18:26.780
F-Flip... Flapping...

00:18:26.780 --> 00:18:28.000
I can't hear you!

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:29.000
Shut it!

00:18:31.270 --> 00:18:32.360
Yayaka.

00:18:33.240 --> 00:18:36.260
Look, this is only until we 
take that thing out, okay?

00:18:37.020 --> 00:18:37.870
Okay!

00:18:38.410 --> 00:18:40.020
Bring out the war cry of your soul!

00:18:40.480 --> 00:18:44.380
Flip Flapping!

00:19:06.110 --> 00:19:08.830
Great Pacoya... take off!

00:19:08.830 --> 00:19:09.590
Boop.

00:19:12.580 --> 00:19:13.790
Upgrade!

00:19:20.510 --> 00:19:21.950
Where should we aim?

00:19:21.950 --> 00:19:22.800
The head!

00:19:27.340 --> 00:19:28.470
Pacoya Nova!

00:19:42.560 --> 00:19:44.120
Target eliminated!

00:20:02.050 --> 00:20:04.510
This belongs to those girls.

00:20:04.840 --> 00:20:06.400
Think you can beat us?

00:20:06.810 --> 00:20:07.730
You stupid?

00:20:17.730 --> 00:20:18.820
We're leaving.

00:20:19.930 --> 00:20:21.290
Making no sense.

00:20:21.290 --> 00:20:23.070
They're almost here.

00:20:23.400 --> 00:20:25.280
The odds are against us right now.

00:20:25.940 --> 00:20:27.330
We can steal it anytime.

00:20:27.840 --> 00:20:29.240
Will report this.

00:20:37.570 --> 00:20:39.340
Pops!

00:20:45.830 --> 00:20:48.220
Sorry we wrecked your city!

00:20:48.220 --> 00:20:49.140
No big deal!

00:20:49.140 --> 00:20:50.760
Art is explosive!

00:20:50.760 --> 00:20:53.200
Explosive!

00:21:05.660 --> 00:21:07.030
Hup!

00:21:11.710 --> 00:21:14.290
Not when I'm so busy, damn it!

00:21:14.290 --> 00:21:16.490
Talk about a major hassle!

00:21:18.320 --> 00:21:20.590
I'm running low on 
replacement stocks, too.

00:21:21.290 --> 00:21:24.320
This is why old models suck!

00:21:25.180 --> 00:21:26.840
Want me to make you some tea,

00:21:27.000 --> 00:21:28.520
Dr. Hidaka?

00:23:01.390 --> 00:23:05.200
Fragment, fragment, frag-frag-ment!

00:23:08.840 --> 00:23:12.370
We managed to protect it, right?

00:23:13.310 --> 00:23:14.180
Yeah!

00:23:14.460 --> 00:23:16.370
It really is more fun when we're together!

00:23:21.210 --> 00:23:21.710
I agree—

00:23:21.710 --> 00:23:23.180
Let's go again,

00:23:23.580 --> 00:23:24.210
Mimi!

00:23:28.210 --> 00:23:29.050
What?

00:23:31.750 --> 00:23:33.580
I'm never gonna do a preview.

00:23:33.580 --> 00:23:35.480
Please. You're our only hope.

00:23:35.480 --> 00:23:37.090
Tch. Fine.

00:23:37.090 --> 00:23:38.020
Next time on <i>Flip—</i>

00:23:38.020 --> 00:23:39.150
Oh, we're out of time!

00:23:38.020 --> 00:23:41.020
Pure Mute

00:23:39.150 --> 00:23:40.550
What the hell?!
